Notes for CASINO runs:

* eCPP pseudopotentials defined in w.py match the CASINO-formatted
  x_pp.data files in the pseudopotentials directory.

* The w.py script will produce an input.molden file.  To convert to
  CASINO format gwfn.data:
  - edit the input.molden file and in the [Atoms] section ensure
    that the 3rd element is the atomic number not the pseudocharge
  - run:
      python /path/to/CASINO/utils/wfn_converters/molden/molden2qmc.py --pseudoatoms all 1 input.molden
